      {
        "id": "liturgy-ts-block-01",
        "kind": "body",
        "bbox_xywh": [
          95,
          1075,
          953,
          424
        ],
        "geometry_estimated": true,
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "liturgy-ts-line-01",
            "text": "(Слово ѡ ст҃ѣй литоргїи ст҃ого апⷭла Павла ѿ",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              95,
              1075,
              953,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-147-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 44,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-ts-line-02",
            "text": "Прелога). Бысть Анфилогъ ѿ цр҃ьскаго рода, не вѣдавше за-",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              95,
              1111,
              953,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-147-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 57,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-ts-line-03",
            "text": "кона и не вѣровал распятомꙋ Хсꙋ҃, и держал Сарацены. И поихалъ",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              95,
              1146,
              953,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-147-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 62,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-ts-line-04",
            "text": "Анфилогъ къ братꙋ своему въ Ієрⷭлимъ, и видѣл там цр҃ков",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              95,
              1182,
              953,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-147-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 56,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-ts-line-05",
            "text": "хрⷭтїанскꙋю повелѣ слꙋгам своим ити въ цр҃ков по ієрея, и мл҃яхꙋ",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              95,
              1218,
              953,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-147-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 64,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-ts-line-06",
            "text": "єго, да иде къ цр҃ю; ѡн же не послꙋшал их, бяше бо готов",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              95,
              1253,
              953,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-147-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 56,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-ts-line-07",
            "text": "ко ст҃ой литргїи. И внииде въ цр҃ков Анфилог, не токмо сам, но",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              95,
              1289,
              953,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-147-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 62,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-ts-line-08",
            "text": "и с верблюды. Ієрей же заборонял ємꙋ гл҃я: „яко готов єсмъ",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              95,
              1325,
              953,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-147-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 58,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-ts-line-09",
            "text": "къ ст҃ой литргїи“. и пали верблюды и поздыхали. И реклъ",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              95,
              1360,
              953,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-147-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 55,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-ts-line-10",
            "text": "Анфилог: „Хощꙋ видѣти вѣрꙋ вашꙋ поганьскꙋю и слꙋжбꙋ“.",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              95,
              1396,
              953,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-147-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 53,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-ts-line-11",
            "text": "И въшед въ ѡлтар и начал смотрити пилно, яко совершаеⷮ сѧ",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              95,
              1431,
              953,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-147-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 57,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-ts-line-12",
            "text": "ст҃ая литргїя.",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              95,
              1467,
              953,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-147-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 14,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "liturgy-ts-block-02",
        "kind": "body",
        "bbox_xywh": [
          95,
          1503,
          953,
          103
        ],
        "geometry_estimated": true,
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "liturgy-ts-line-13",
            "text": "И видѣл поганый цр҃ь попа пристꙋпающа ко ст҃мꙋ прⷭтолꙋ,",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              95,
              1503,
              953,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-147-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 55,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-ts-line-14",
            "text": "и просвѣти сѧ лице єго яко сл҃нце, и ризы єго были яко ѡгнен-",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              95,
              1538,
              953,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-147-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 61,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-ts-line-15",
            "text": "ны. И пристꙋпи къ жертовникꙋ и не показа Бг҃ъ поганомꙋ цр҃ю",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              95,
              1574,
              953,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-147-image-20261127",
